[Tt]emp/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]ogs/
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]uilds/
[Rr]elease/
[Rr]eleases/
OverPower/Release/
OverPower/Build/
OverPower/Builds/
UserSettings/
